   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <gap reason="published"/>
                    <div type="published">
                        <bibl>LI 425</bibl>
                        <p>Pauvre Ruggiero, pauvres Gideon et <hi rend="underline">pover</hi>’ <hi rend="underline">a</hi> <hi rend="underline">me</hi>!</p>
                        <closer>
                            <salute>cordialement votre</salute>
                            <signed>
                                <name type="person" key="joyc82">James Joyce</name>
                            </signed>
                        </closer>
                    </div>
                    <postscript>
                        <p>
                            <label>P.S.</label> <name type="person" key="gied88">M et</name> <name type="person" key="gied93">M<hi rend="underline">
                                    <hi rend="superscript">me</hi>
                                </hi> G.</name> <choice>
                                <sic>commandent</sic>
                                <corr>recommandent</corr>
                            </choice> <name type="person" key="augs02">M. Augsbourg</name>. Ils m’ont écrit que je pourrais avoir pleine confiance en lui. En effet il semblait très amical et gentil.</p>
                    </postscript>
                </div>
                <div type="translation">
                    <p>
                        <label>P.S.</label> Mr and Mrs G. commend Mr Augsbourg. They wrote to me that I can have full confidence in him. Indeed, he seemed very friendly and kind.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
      </body>
